 
 


 
 resource  config   app app config   -  str json dumps 
         
             name    filesystemdemo  
             version    1 0 0  
             features     tools    resources    prompts   
          
        indent 2 
     


 
 resource  config   env  env env config env  str  -  str 
     
    configs    
         dev     debug log level    debug    database    localhost   
         staging     debug log level    info    database    staging-db   
         prod     debug log level    warning    database    prod-db   
     
